    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="bb3a6f9e-9164-5ea4-8915-05715ec99cd6" activityNameId="0faea3dd-6546-59ab-9081-45c56babde12" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Gallium, semiconductor-grade, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Gallium, semiconductor-grade, at plant
Production of gallium from Bayer-liquor, purification to 99.9999% (6N);
CAS number: 007440-55-3; 
Formula: Ga; 
UUID: 86af7fa7-c7ea-3f7d-833f-748cbe8a29ff
The energy consumption and auxiliary materials are considered for, emissions are estimated.
Location: Production in GLO.
Technology: The module includes the production and purification of high grade gallium (99.9999%) by hydrometallurgical processes (Rhõne-Poulenc-Process).
Time period: patents and literatur
Production volume: 60 t in 2005
Sampling: Analysis based on literature. 
Extrapolations: For the electrolysis, the proxy-value of copper is used, the infrastructure is estimated with related chemical plants
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_86af7fa7-c7ea-3f7d-833f-748cbe8a29ff.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
